7: const MODEL = 'deepseek/deepseek-chat-v3-0324';
8: const API = 'https://openrouter.ai/api/v1';
9: // Lowered from 10 to pay for the larger per-request budget below. Bytes have been the binding
10: // constraint in every run; no run has ever used more than five requests.
11: const MAX_REQUESTS = 8;
12: const MAX_OUTPUT = 4096;
13: // Raised from 80,000, then from 120,000. The second rise paid for a run that, under the citation
14: // guard, read five files including this repository's whole experiment log and reached 116,999
15: // serialized tool bytes without ever sending its answer. The worst-case cost bound is unchanged,
16: // because MAX_REQUESTS fell from 10 to 8 in exchange. This is the third time the repository has
17: // outgrown its own research budget, and raising the number is still not a structural answer.
18: const MAX_CONTEXT_BYTES = 160_000;
